C) Only the plant's shareholders, since they own the plant and are liable for its hazards
D) The plant's customers, since they buy the products made at the plant
= A
? Projects at major hazard sites affect emergency planning outside the site, so emergency services and the responsible authorities are key stakeholders.

@@ PE4 | Agile
Business units ignore the security programme and see it as an obstacle. Which engagement approach would help most?
A) Appoint security champions in each unit and involve them in prioritising the work
B) Send a monthly email reminding the business units of the security policy and its rules
C) Ask the chief executive to order the business units to cooperate fully
