= A
? Champions inside each unit bring local knowledge and influence, and involving them in prioritisation builds ownership.

@@ PE4 | Hybrid
A new student system requires changes to academic regulations, which the faculty senate must approve. What should the project manager do?
A) Engage the senate early and plan the approval into the schedule
B) Implement the system first and ask the senate to approve afterwards
C) Ask the IT department to present the changes to the senate at the end
D) Avoid the senate by describing the changes as technical updates
= A
