@@ PE4 | Predictive
The project manager classifies stakeholders by their influence over the project and the impact the project has on them. Which tool is this?
A) An influence/impact grid
B) A resource histogram
C) A probability/impact matrix
D) A RACI chart
= A
? Grids such as power/interest and influence/impact help prioritise stakeholders and plan suitable engagement.

@@ PE4 | Predictive
A powerful department head blocks decisions in group meetings without explaining why. What should the project manager do first?
A) Meet her one-to-one to understand her concerns
B) Escalate her behaviour to the sponsor immediately
C) Exclude her from future decision meetings
D) Make decisions when she is not present
