@@ PE4 | Hybrid
The plant's insurer could lower its premiums if certain safety improvements are made. What should the project manager do?
A) Engage the insurer early to understand its criteria, and include them where they add value
B) Ignore the insurer, since it has no formal role in the plant's safety upgrade project
C) Ask the insurer to pay for the safety improvements in exchange for lower premiums
