D) Release the features secretly during the exams and fix any problems as they appear
= A
? Explaining constraints in advance, with a clear view of when features will arrive, keeps expectations realistic.

@@ PE5 | Hybrid
The plant manager expects no production downtime, but the safety upgrade requires a ten-day shutdown. What should the project manager do?
A) Explain why the shutdown is needed and plan it with operations, e.g. during scheduled maintenance
