@@ PE8 | Predictive | fill
A project team has 66 communication channels. How many people are on the team, including the project manager? (Answer with a number.)
= 12
? Channels = n(n − 1)/2. Solving n(n − 1)/2 = 66 gives n(n − 1) = 132, so n = 12 (12 × 11 = 132).

